   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Cache-aside vs read-through\n\u2022 TTL and invalidation on write\n\u2022 Hot keys: replicate or local cache\n\u2022 Replica lag: read-your-writes from primary\n\u2022 Stampede: lock or request coalescing",
